  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "'# [8.0.0-prerelease.4](https://github.com/smartive/zitadel-net/compare/v8.0.0-prerelease.3...v8.0.0-prerelease.4) (2026-09-14)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **api:** renew service account tokens based on expires_in ([d0f11d1](https://github.com/smartive/zitadel-net/commit/d0f11d15a0f73a60471c947c77ba9138b6c930e8)), closes [smartive/zitadel-net#1027](https://github.com/smartive/zitadel-net/issues/1027)\n\n\n### BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* **api:** ServiceAccount.AuthenticateAsync and ServiceAccount.Authenticate\nreturn a ServiceAccount.AccessToken instead of a string. Read the Token property for\nthe previous value; ExpiresAt carries the lifetime reported by the token endpoint.\n\n\n\n'",
